*================================================================*
* Views Definition
* Subject : DRIVING-HISTORY entity views
*================================================================*

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VHISTORY-ALL
* Desc : Full driving history view
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VHISTORY-ALL OF DRIVING-HISTORY
  HISTORY-ID
  CANDIDATE-ID
  INCIDENT-DATE
  INCIDENT-TYPE
  INCIDENT-DESCRIPTION
  DEMERIT-POINTS
  FINE-AMOUNT
  FINE-PAID-STATUS
  SUSPENSION-START-DATE
  SUSPENSION-END-DATE
  COURT-CASE-NUMBER
  RECORDED-BY-AUTHORITY
  RECORD-STATUS

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VHISTORY-CHECK
* Desc : View used during automated history check
*         returns active adverse records for a candidate
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VHISTORY-CHECK OF DRIVING-HISTORY
  CANDIDATE-ID
  INCIDENT-TYPE
  INCIDENT-DATE
  DEMERIT-POINTS
  FINE-PAID-STATUS
  SUSPENSION-START-DATE
  SUSPENSION-END-DATE
  RECORD-STATUS

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VHISTORY-SUMMARY
* Desc : Display summary of history records
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VHISTORY-SUMMARY OF DRIVING-HISTORY
  HISTORY-ID
  CANDIDATE-ID
  INCIDENT-DATE
  INCIDENT-TYPE
  INCIDENT-DESCRIPTION
  DEMERIT-POINTS
  RECORD-STATUS
